    "source_review": [
      "Original main physical pages 2\u20134: randomized Part 1 48 across placebo/2/5/9-dose arms; 9-month 24h UPCR is source-designated primary. Article efficacy PPS 41 and n39 at month9; seven exposure exclusions and prohibited-therapy observations excluded. No all-randomized observation claim.",
      "Rendered original supplement physical page19 Table S2 confirms signed month9 profile -5.7,-12.5,-12.8,-29.5 and n10/11/8/10. Methods describe LS means/MMRM while row says Mean(SD); source-table/statistic conflict retained, not resolved by host.",
      "Article page4 explicitly reports dose-versus-placebo reductions 6.8/7.1/23.8 with respective CIs; current registry FAS/log analysis, absolute g/g Table S3 and month24 alternatives retained. All dose contrasts kept without pooling or selecting most favorable. Historical designation/timing not inferred."
    ]
